    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Which entry of UnderwaterZoneManager's per-zone arrays this volume uses
        for fog/ambient/deep-pressure color grading (0 = Harbor, 1 = OpenOcean, 2
        = DeepSea). All the actual color/density values live on the zone manager,
        not here, so the whole dive's grading can be tuned from one place.
