      Entry: 1
      Data: Shared occupancy manager. Required so overlapping water volumes (Harbor/OpenOcean/DeepSea,
        which deliberately overlap along the elevator's dive path) don't fight over
        global RenderSettings - leaving one zone while still inside another must
        not restore the pre-underwater state.
